  "bodyHash": "c1d163f758b9f727",
  "content": "<h2><strong><img src=\"https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/398651394447507457/941908335114989648/Untitled.png\"></strong></h2>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h2 style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</h2>\n<h2 style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>简介</strong></h2>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong><strong>Calemi's Economy</strong> 添加了一个<strong>完全功能的经济系统！</strong> 货币形式是通过挖掘<strong>Raritanium Ore</strong>获得的，可以在洞穴深处找到。一旦挖掘，<strong>Coins</strong>可以进行一对一的兑换。你可以将<strong>Coins</strong>存储在一个物品（<strong>Wallet</strong>）或一个方块（<strong>Bank</strong>）中。<strong>Trading Posts</strong>可以用来<strong>买卖其他玩家的物品</strong>！<strong>Trading Posts</strong>可以通过漏斗自动填充库存来实现完全自动化。</strong></span></p>\n<h2>&nbsp;</h2>\n<h2 style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>视频（即将推出）&nbsp;<strong><br></strong></strong></h2>\n<h2>&nbsp;</h2>\n<h2 style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><strong>功能</strong></strong></h2>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/398651394447507457/941909707419963422/raritanium_ore.png\" width=\"169\" height=\"187\"></p>\n<h2><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong>Raritanium Ore</strong></span></h2>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>Raritanium Ore</strong>可以在主世界的洞穴深处找到。可以从中开采<strong>Raritanium</strong>，每个<strong>Raritanium</strong>可以制作成一枚<strong>铜币。</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong><img src=\"https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/398651394447507457/941911324668084224/Untitled2.png\"></strong></span></p>\n<h3><strong>硬币</strong></h3>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>硬币</strong>有4种不同的版本，每种都有其价值。<strong>铜：1RC，银：5RC，金：25RC，白金：100RC</strong>。<strong>硬币</strong>也可以<strong>堆叠放置</strong>（需要<strong>8个</strong><strong>硬币</strong>）。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><img src=\"https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/398651394447507457/941912658733576232/wallet.png\"><img src=\"https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/398651394447507457/941914309724880916/2022-02-11_23.28.23.png\" width=\"315\" height=\"315\"></span></p>\n<h3><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong>钱包</strong></span></h3>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>钱包</strong>用于存放个人货币！默认情况下，<strong>钱包</strong>可以容纳<strong>最多1百万RC</strong>。<strong>钱包</strong>还可以输出你希望的硬币（只要你的RC充足即可）！<strong>钱包</strong>也可以放置在一个自定义<strong>钱包饰品槽位</strong>中！</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><img src=\"https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/398651394447507457/941914856158818304/bank.png\" width=\"152\" height=\"168\"></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><img src=\"https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/398651394447507457/941914309959745546/2022-02-11_23.29.15.png\" width=\"314\" height=\"226\"></span></p>\n<h3><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong>银行</strong></span></h3>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>银行</strong>用于以方块的形式储存货币。与<strong>钱包</strong>一样，<strong>银行</strong>最多可以容纳<strong>100万RC</strong>！可以将<strong>钱包</strong>放入其中存入或提取存款。注意：<strong>同一网络中的两个<strong>银行</strong>将会同时失效</strong>。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><img src=\"https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/398651394447507457/941916034175229982/trading_post.png\" width=\"168\" height=\"98\"></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><img src=\"https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/398651394447507457/941914310182051841/2022-02-11_23.29.44.png\" width=\"303\" height=\"399\"></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h3><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong>交易站</strong></span></h3>\n<span style=\"font-size:14px\">使用<strong>交易站</strong>可以建立一个商店，让其他玩家可以使用<strong>RC</strong>进行购买或出售物品。配合安全扳手使用时，<strong>交易站</strong>将显示<strong>GUI界面</strong>。在此界面中，您可以切换<strong>买卖模式</strong>、设置<strong>交易物品</strong>、<strong>数量</strong>和<strong>价格</strong>。您还可以通过<strong>网络电缆广播</strong>您的交易站信息给服务器上的所有人。<strong>交易站</strong>需要通过<strong>货币网络电缆</strong>连接到一个银行。</span>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><img src=\"https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/398651394447507457/941915678854758400/currency_network_cable_core.png\" width=\"94\" height=\"104\"></span></p>\n<h3><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong>货币网络电缆</strong></span></h3>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>货币网络电缆</strong>可用于将多个<strong>交易站</strong>连接到中心<strong>银行</strong>。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><img src=\"https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/398651394447507457/941917264737890324/security_wrench.png\"></span></p>\n<h3><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong>安全系统和安全扳手</strong></span></h3>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">该模组包含一个<strong>安全系统</strong>，旨在保护玩家的<strong>银行</strong>、<strong>交易站</strong>和<strong>网络</strong>。此系统仅允许在放置时确定的<strong>所有者</strong>交互或破坏受保护的方块。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>安全扳手</strong>用于轻松移除受保护的方块。同时它也用于访问<strong>交易站GUI界面</strong>。请注意：使用该扳手的<strong>必须是方块的所有者</strong>。</span></p>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h2 style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>模组包政策</strong></h2>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>您可以在任何模组包中使用此模组，无论是公开的还是私有的。只是不要声称这个模组是你的！**</strong></span></p>",
